{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange Froggos sticky note world, solve the puzzles at your own pace and experience a wholesome, pressure-free world. Unwind and enjoy the narrative gameplay. Cuddle up in your most comfortable blanket, grab a mug of tea and embark on a journey about friendship and facing challenges together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/1f6bcc99c950a2fd25ffe98b344d5222.poster.avif?t=1764399938\" width=848 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/1f6bcc99c950a2fd25ffe98b344d5222.webm?t=1764399938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/1f6bcc99c950a2fd25ffe98b344d5222.mp4?t=1764399938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk The Frog is a cozy and heartwarming point&amp;click adventure, combining a unique puzzle mechanic with easy drag&amp;drop movements. Make new quirky friends, help each other out and overcome many obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/b4220498ebfd6d7ff85873bdde98a4e2.poster.avif?t=1764399938\" width=832 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/b4220498ebfd6d7ff85873bdde98a4e2.webm?t=1764399938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/b4220498ebfd6d7ff85873bdde98a4e2.mp4?t=1764399938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a lovingly handcrafted visual style and enchanting soundtrack, Walk The Frog will accompany you through all the challenging moments of the year. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/07660ae27865595bea9531f0da06031d.poster.avif?t=1764399938\" width=802 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/07660ae27865595bea9531f0da06031d.webm?t=1764399938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/07660ae27865595bea9531f0da06031d.mp4?t=1764399938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3336240?t=1764399938","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764399938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/3a83776a2a1898f34807ae2621b0aab336dd58ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764399938","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/3a83776a2a1898f34807ae2621b0aab336dd58ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764399938","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4028420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange Froggos sticky note world, solve the puzzles at your own pace and exp